 "remarks": "Fantastic opportunity in West Norwalk to own this generous size updated 2 Bd. 1.5 Ba. townhouse in most sought-after neighborhoods. Fillow Ridge is a beautiful, secluded and quiet development that is well maintained, reflecting pride of ownership throughout, close to everything Norwalk has to offer. Sun filled well appointed corner unit, hardwood floor throughout, fireplace, sliding door opens to the deck overviewing nature. Eat-in kitchen, brand new kitchen cabinets, quarts counter top and stainless steel appliances. Remodeled half a bath on the main floor and Jack and Jill full bath in the upper level with washer and dryer in the unit. Central airconditioning. Brand new window and roof. Low Taxes and HOA common charges. Move-in condition, most important if not all updates were completed during sellers occupancy. Such as Central air, Hot Water Tank, Windows with custom shades, Roof, Hardwood Floor throughout, remodeled both Bathrooms , Kitchen, Stainless Steel Appliances, etc... Listing broker related to the seller.",
